      "version": 355,
      "versionNonce": 383462001,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791995086176,
      "created": 1791994889605,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) everyone gonna have the prototype chain like that \n\n    person\n  │\n  │ [[Prototype]]\n  ↓\nObject.prototype\n  │\n  │ [[Prototype]]\n  ↓\nnull                          means nowhere else to search\n\n\niii) how to assign one \n\n       const new_obj = Object.create(our_obj);\n    \n        now the new_obj inherit proerties from our_obj\n            due to the prototype game\n\n    .hasOwnProperty();\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) everyone gonna have the prototype chain like that \n\n    person\n  │\n  │ [[Prototype]]\n  ↓\nObject.prototype\n  │\n  │ [[Prototype]]\n  ↓\nnull                          means nowhere else to search\n\n\niii) how to assign one \n\n       const new_obj = Object.create(our_obj);\n    \n        now the new_obj inherit proerties from our_obj\n            due to the prototype game\n\n    .hasOwnProperty();\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "flOc8myoo_id60NLyA8h1",
      "type": "text",
