      "updated": 1791995690283,
      "created": 1791995572572,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. scope -> i'll make it better but for now \n\n    var -> uses the lexical scope \n            same for => fxns \n\n  lexical scope -> is the scope of block {} in which u live\n  vs closure    -> closure is the combo u carrying in mem \n               \n         like ur fxn + surr variables that u can access",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. scope -> i'll make it better but for now \n\n    var -> uses the lexical scope \n            same for => fxns \n\n  lexical scope -> is the scope of block {} in which u live\n  vs closure    -> closure is the combo u carrying in mem \n               \n         like ur fxn + surr variables that u can access",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
