      "text": "0.  i) npm init -> creates package.json  || -y flag yes to all\n   ii) npm install pkg_nme -> install packages || --save-dev \n                                                            (devonly)\n   iii) npx tsc --init  -> typescript.json (i&iiisee the pttrn)",
