      "updated": 1791973664199,
      "created": 1791492182100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. only one new info -> is ts automatically looks at the function's internal returns \n        and make the function return type to all the type ones u are returning \n\n                like add function -> can have return a+b  or some if return invalid as string \n\n                    makes add function return  type =  number | \"invalid\"  (instance of string primitive)",
      "fontSize": 26.602327898288603,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. only one new info -> is ts automatically looks at the function's internal returns \n        and make the function return type to all the type ones u are returning \n\n                like add function -> can have return a+b  or some if return invalid as string \n\n                    makes add function return  type =  number | \"invalid\"  (instance of string primitive)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
