      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. parameter in constructor \n\n        i) optional parameter -> use  ? after parameter name in constructor \n\n                    ex -> fxn( middlename? : string)   -> now middle name is optional",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. parameter in constructor \n\n        i) optional parameter -> use  ? after parameter name in constructor \n\n                    ex -> fxn( middlename? : string)   -> now middle name is optional",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lSOWbEd376rrbnpKCeAQj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -476.90906644036806,
