      "updated": 1791973664199,
      "created": 1791493245432,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. learned -> how to write\n\n            when u pass a function as a parameter how to make it typesafe \n                            basically define its parameters type + return type \n\n            ex syntax ->  \n        \n               function papa(fxn_name: (prop_name: type, pn_2: type) => return_type_consFXN,\n  \n                                para2: type, etc -> like other function as para or just prop as parameter)\n ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. learned -> how to write\n\n            when u pass a function as a parameter how to make it typesafe \n                            basically define its parameters type + return type \n\n            ex syntax ->  \n        \n               function papa(fxn_name: (prop_name: type, pn_2: type) => return_type_consFXN,\n  \n                                para2: type, etc -> like other function as para or just prop as parameter) \n ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Rd1fNnyCN8yV0T0LM0bsO",
