      "created": 1791995961961,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Access Modifiers \n\n    by default -> its public \n\n   private -> means only this class can access  (not even inherited members)\n    \n    protected -> only the class and its inherited parties \n\n    public -> anyone in the module / package \n  ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Access Modifiers \n\n    by default -> its public \n\n   private -> means only this class can access  (not even inherited members)\n    \n    protected -> only the class and its inherited parties \n\n    public -> anyone in the module / package \n  ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
