      "text": "1. if u are using a combo of pre-existing types like -> [String, String]  (maybe mking a hsmap)\n    \n        and using them alot \n            -> u should pack them up as one type\n\n                    type kv = [String, String];\n\n        store(user_keyval: kv): kv{\n            return [\"fk\", \"u\"];\n        }\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
