      "originalText": "3. Type Guards ->\n    \n         main keywords we use to check type ->\n\n        typeof  ,   instanceof ,    in   or  the custom is Fucntion    etc....\n\n              ex-> (typeof val_variable === \"papaji\")\n\n                   ii)  animal instanceof cat   -> true if cat class uses instance of animal\n    \n                   iii) \"proertyName\" in class/object_name  -> \"lastname\" in person -> true",
