      "created": 1792061960603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Discriminated Union  -> they are just wrappers man  uwrite the wrapper \n                    \n                                                                      =>  type<interface_to_wrap>\n\n        have 5 major types -> for makign optional\n                                    readonly\n                                    key val\n                                    permit some prope\n                                    omit \n\n        for interface || idk for objects wanna try them up\n\n\n5. imports exports -> same as js -> default import export \n            \n        and nammed ones we already know\n\n\n    ii) import xyz from \"./folder/folder/file_name\"  -> dono't use .ts \n\n    iii) if import is back out from ur directory ->   \"../folder_name/file_name\"\n            \n            .. uses the parent directory in which ur file is / one directory out  \n\n                    ../../folder/file   -> for 2 layers back",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Discriminated Union  -> they are just wrappers man  uwrite the wrapper \n                    \n                                                                      =>  type<interface_to_wrap>\n\n        have 5 major types -> for makign optional\n                                    readonly\n                                    key val\n                                    permit some prope\n                                    omit \n\n        for interface || idk for objects wanna try them up\n\n\n5. imports exports -> same as js -> default import export \n            \n        and nammed ones we already know\n\n\n    ii) import xyz from \"./folder/folder/file_name\"  -> dono't use .ts \n\n    iii) if import is back out from ur directory ->   \"../folder_name/file_name\"\n            \n            .. uses the parent directory in which ur file is / one directory out  \n\n                    ../../folder/file   -> for 2 layers back",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
